{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "AArch64 scalar subset experiment.  Custom: scalar 32-bit shifts, scalar abs, and the 32/64-bit popcount/cttz pairs.  Libcall: 128-bit division/remainder.  Lower: the scalar remainder family, overflow/high-multiply, carry-producing add/sub, min/max, and 128-bit abs.",
